#: c1a53e4ddccd426b986de60b605f8f71
msgid "基于 E(3) 等变图卷积的 HamGNN 模型。"
msgstr "HamGNN model based on E(3) equivariant graph convolutions."

#: 02633dc8fc104a159121af3efd654734
msgid ""
"该模型通过堆叠多个等变卷积层来学习原子及其相互作用的表示。 每一层都会更新原子（节点）和原子对（边）的特征，同时严格保持在旋转下的等变性。 "
"最终输出节点和边的等变特征，用于后续的物理属性预测。"
msgstr ""
"This model learns representations of atoms and their interactions by stacking "
"multiple equivariant convolutional layers. Each layer updates the features of "
"atoms (nodes) and atomic pairs (edges) while strictly maintaining "
"equivariance under rotation. The final output consists of equivariant "
"features for nodes and edges, which are used for subsequent prediction of "
"physical properties."

