#: 855983cbdd634ef48104e259e46f0139
msgid "基于 E(3) 等变 Transformer 的 HamGNN 模型。"
msgstr "HamGNN model based on E(3) equivariant Transformer."

#: 414b275e1dee47a78baa7c1ede5a8248
msgid ""
"该模型采用等变自注意力机制来捕捉原子间的相互作用，替代了传统的卷积操作。 它允许模型在更新节点特征时，动态地权衡来自不同邻居的信息。 "
"模型的整体结构与 `HamGNNConvE3` 相似，但核心交互层换成了 `AttentionBlockE3`。"
msgstr ""
"This model uses an equivariant self-attention mechanism to capture "
"interactions between atoms, replacing traditional convolution operations. It "
"allows the model to dynamically weigh information from different neighbors "
"when updating node features. The overall structure of the model is similar "
"to `HamGNNConvE3`, but the core interaction layer is replaced with "
"`AttentionBlockE3`."

#: 0068f8c29d4b4214af9b01f57936a1f2
msgid "等变 Transformer 层的数量。"
msgstr "Number of equivariant Transformer layers."

#: 4f0e4c87df86440098f874485db679a4
msgid "自注意力机制中的头数。"
msgstr "Number of heads in the self-attention mechanism."

#: 83967bc28ae2450e91fe06b0e439181b
msgid "等变 Transformer 层列表。"
msgstr "List of equivariant Transformer layers."

#: 1bc7fb5a177e4f1d85b814aaa96be4a9
msgid "相关性乘积层列表。"
msgstr "List of correlation product layers."

#: 4bc7400f43ba4946b103eb917b4c46d3
msgid "基类：:py:class:`~torch.nn.modules.module.Module`"
msgstr "Bases: :py:class:`~torch.nn.modules.module.Module`"

#: 658f3ca510644456bc6bd3586b23a0ca
msgid "HamGNN 的输出模块，用于构建物理哈密顿量并计算相关属性。"
msgstr "Output module for HamGNN, used to construct the physical Hamiltonian and compute related properties."

#: ef0952e1d75a41c9b71f64354c3ea835
msgid ""
"这个模块接收图神经网络编码的等变特征，并利用这些特征作为系数， 通过 Clebsch-Gordan 张量积将它们组合成完整的哈密顿量 (H) "
"和重叠矩阵 (S)。 它能够处理多种 DFT 软件（如 OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS）的基组，支持自旋轨道耦合（SOC）、 "
"自旋约束计算，并能最终求解能带结构。"
msgstr ""
"This module receives equivariant features encoded by the graph neural "
"network and uses them as coefficients to construct the complete Hamiltonian "
"(H) and overlap matrix (S) via Clebsch-Gordan tensor products. It can handle "
"basis sets from various DFT software (e.g., OpenMX, SIESTA, ABACUS), "
"supports spin-orbit coupling (SOC), spin-constrained calculations, and can "
"ultimately solve for the band structure."

#: 5b1a2faa6edc481ba4e2e3c8d9997e77
msgid "这个类的实现非常复杂，因为它紧密地耦合了物理学（量子化学、固体物理） 和 E(3) 等变神经网络的数学原理。"
msgstr "The implementation of this class is highly complex as it tightly couples physics (quantum chemistry, solid-state physics) with the mathematical principles of E(3) equivariant neural networks."

#: 4359b8be7a654c35aa30457bde6f4e30
msgid "预设的最大原子轨道数。"
msgstr "Preset maximum number of atomic orbitals."

#: 10118d0d7e8044459c5efc9fc1f5f169
msgid "使用的 DFT 基组类型 (例如 'openmx')。"
msgstr "Type of DFT basis set used (e.g., 'openmx')."

#: cc6aea01f0c24ecfbc246ff8fad80550
msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

#: 525ab69532bc43a18f96c40b3718e485
msgid "如果为 True，则只计算哈密顿量，不计算重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "If True, only the Hamiltonian is computed, not the overlap matrix."

#: 15a902ecf5174d949dadbc51d160063c 6463c7475ff145388af4aafa0d1cfc59
#: e60ffea0458843c3a200e6053e39f726
msgid "bool"
msgstr "bool"

#: 55356062867741349eaabf378881f4dd
msgid "是否启用自旋轨道耦合计算。"
msgstr "Whether to enable spin-orbit coupling calculation."

#: 541fe8b735a8406abe814253df0ce843
msgid "是否进行自旋约束计算。"
msgstr "Whether to perform spin-constrained calculation."

#: c43de6070b1f42efb85b1486e13a2cb1
msgid "哈密顿量/重叠矩阵块的不可约表示。"
msgstr "Irreducible representations of the Hamiltonian/overlap matrix blocks."

#: 32fe2c2cc6f24f8893a08cc176f72351
msgid "用于从节点特征预测 onsite 哈密顿量块的网络。"
msgstr "Network for predicting onsite Hamiltonian blocks from node features."

#: 6b3a5d8d76b8432a8788dac91a3c5dbf
msgid "用于从边特征预测 offsite 哈密顿量块的网络。"
msgstr "Network for predicting offsite Hamiltonian blocks from edge features."

#: 909e4be215584c6a9edc415c715b48d9
msgid "用于计算 Clebsch-Gordan 系数的工具。"
msgstr "Tool for calculating Clebsch-Gordan coefficients."

#: c03aec744de7436db270377bc8d424d1
msgid "ClebschGordanCoefficients"
msgstr "ClebschGordanCoefficients"

#: 1b1042f2bed349d79992ec74cc558d9f
msgid "将一系列球谐系数（等变特征）通过 Clebsch-Gordan 积合并成矩阵块。"
msgstr "Merges a series of spherical harmonic coefficients (equivariant features) into matrix blocks via Clebsch-Gordan products."

#: 5f4de16b675d4fad946f684fbfab9870
msgid "这是模型的核心步骤之一，它将神经网络预测的抽象特征（`sph_split`） 转换为物理上可解释的哈密顿量或重叠矩阵的组成部分。"
msgstr "This is one of the core steps of the model, converting abstract features (`sph_split`) predicted by the neural network into physically interpretable components of the Hamiltonian or overlap matrix."

#: 7da93db94d61463a92a24a33d80d50c5
msgid "一个张量列表，每个张量对应 `self.ham_irreps` 中的一个不可约表示的系数。 形状为 `(N_batch, 2L+1)`。"
msgstr "A list of tensors, where each tensor corresponds to the coefficients of an irreducible representation in `self.ham_irreps`. The shape is `(N_batch, 2L+1)`."

#: cf4c3f1e692d4f1bac86ff228f35104f
msgid "合并后的矩阵块，形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max * nao_max)`。"
msgstr "The merged matrix block, with a shape of `(N_batch, nao_max * nao_max)`."

#: cae43fba44b74c49b6f9566c7263344e
msgid "将球谐系数合并为二阶张量（3x3矩阵），用于 SOC 计算中的交换项 J。"
msgstr "Merges spherical harmonic coefficients into a second-order tensor (3x3 matrix) for the exchange term J in SOC calculations."

#: e42d8a996b7b4c439c3546cb6885695e
msgid "对应 `self.J_irreps` 的球谐系数列表。"
msgstr "List of spherical harmonic coefficients corresponding to `self.J_irreps`."

#: 8dd893d6f6814694869188f0fc052433
msgid "形状为 `(N_batch, N_blocks, 3, 3)` 的张量。"
msgstr "A tensor with a shape of `(N_batch, N_blocks, 3, 3)`."

#: 36cf67ee6c874945995fc49ac07e89f0
msgid "将零阶（标量）球谐系数合并为矩阵。"
msgstr "Merges zeroth-order (scalar) spherical harmonic coefficients into a matrix."

#: a814b22d5c8a4ab89cdb52d61e922878
msgid "这用于非 SOC 情况下的交换项 J，其中 J 是一个标量。"
msgstr "This is used for the exchange term J in non-SOC cases, where J is a scalar."

#: b89a78917cd1480b9a8b245af85bc055
msgid "对应零阶 Irreps 的系数列表。"
msgstr "List of coefficients corresponding to zeroth-order Irreps."

#: 30c69961207a4fdfabb1f2f05ea74a94
msgid "形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)` 的矩阵。"
msgstr "A matrix with a shape of `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: e84ad04b4f3146c89d95f180be89d56c
msgid "将拉格朗日乘子（交换场）合并成完整的交换相互作用矩阵 J。"
msgstr "Merges Lagrange multipliers (exchange fields) into the complete exchange interaction matrix J."

#: ed6f37bd59e24e0eadc161ea53aaa504
msgid "神经网络预测的交换场系数。"
msgstr "Exchange field coefficients predicted by the neural network."

#: 657fda2006c94a6bbf32a8e94c4a2f57
msgid ""
"交换相互作用矩阵 J。 如果 `soc_switch` 为 True, 形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max, 3, "
"3)`。 否则，形状为 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`。"
msgstr ""
"The exchange interaction matrix J. If `soc_switch` is True, the shape is "
"`(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max, 3, 3)`. Otherwise, the shape is `(N_batch, "
"nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: 0be1cbee73bf4656b2174c8f277a1add
msgid "将拉格朗日乘子合并成四阶相互作用矩阵 K。"
msgstr "Merges Lagrange multipliers into the fourth-order interaction matrix K."

#: 1e6a80e3751e48d4a5dce17a6b4d1541
msgid "神经网络预测的四阶项系数。"
msgstr "Fourth-order term coefficients predicted by the neural network."

#: 7e06dfeb591d43f9bb8e65405b561ff5
msgid "四阶相互作用矩阵 K，形状 `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`。"
msgstr "The fourth-order interaction matrix K, with a shape of `(N_batch, nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: dcaf2f9c621942109c0b54ee536dbf17
msgid "根据 DFT 软件（如 openmx, siesta）的约定，调整输出矩阵元素的顺序。 这确保了生成的哈密顿量与目标软件的原子轨道顺序相匹配。"
msgstr "Adjusts the order of output matrix elements according to the conventions of DFT software (e.g., openmx, siesta). This ensures that the generated Hamiltonian matches the atomic orbital order of the target software."

#: ef5ec68fcea64f5fa10d98652cb23eb8
msgid "原始哈密顿量矩阵。"
msgstr "The original Hamiltonian matrix."

#: 4183881b2c5949ad9792977cd73c474e
msgid "索引调整后的哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The Hamiltonian after index adjustment."

#: 20a4ff2c3aeb4a2b80d2ae0238df7919
msgid "将 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块组装成完整的分子哈密顿量。 这个函数目前似乎没有被使用。"
msgstr "Assembles onsite and offsite matrix blocks into a complete molecular Hamiltonian. This function does not seem to be currently in use."

#: 94a5c58c97cc414094a096a00b8169da dfdd168c98c64aa69af512ec8a090747
msgid "输入的图数据。"
msgstr "Input graph data."

#: 4a458562f85748af9fed79ec176acd73
msgid "Onsite 哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "Onsite Hamiltonian blocks."

#: 7109e5e9eaa648bea619f730d2fab41a
msgid "Offsite 哈密顿量块。"
msgstr "Offsite Hamiltonian blocks."

#: c54c9e31a19342dc92be14fd153a4a36
msgid "组装后的完整哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The assembled complete Hamiltonian."

#: a4298fa2d5784ece8c68d0e76e2c02e4
msgid "将批处理中的 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块按顺序拼接起来。"
msgstr "Concatenates the onsite and offsite matrix blocks from the batch in order."

#: 6d02ee198fa149d38a1d60af839b8b24 8e9a94054b4c431f959ece659e63caa2
msgid "Onsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Onsite matrix blocks."

#: dde1d62c3b824853baeab6c69c9b2228 fef12a8cd6f441bf83f3c5b2aeb166b0
msgid "Offsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Offsite matrix blocks."

#: dd67d56e82c040b0965cd1fcd17377b1
msgid "拼接后的矩阵块。"
msgstr "The concatenated matrix blocks."

#: e8370e9b7aec45ab99c6a4029ff37e6b
msgid "对称化 Onsite 矩阵块。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes the onsite matrix blocks."

#: a6aa565a9e2f4aa3bb4bb6d11e3c6897
msgid "对称化方式，'+' 表示 (A + A.T)/2 (厄米)，'-' 表示 (A - A.T)/2 (反厄米)。"
msgstr "Symmetrization method, '+' for (A + A.T)/2 (Hermitian), '-' for (A - A.T)/2 (anti-Hermitian)."

#: 9fa4d2ac26614b5a8850ab4382edc6b0 b44e3ceacb144a4a96b9d7a0c48fe67b
msgid "对称化后的矩阵。"
msgstr "The symmetrized matrix."

#: b3c9115811ec442d875026f05416be0d
msgid "对称化 Offsite 矩阵块。 利用 `inv_edge_idx` (逆向边的索引) 来确保 H_ij = H_ji.T。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes the offsite matrix blocks. Uses `inv_edge_idx` (inverse edge index) to ensure H_ij = H_ji.T."

#: 96c8d8b682f24d7f94a9c5d7cbb3bb74
msgid "逆向边的索引。"
msgstr "Inverse edge index."

#: b54fba0d06634d67864890901be5816c
msgid "对称化方式，'+' 或 '-'。"
msgstr "Symmetrization method, '+' or '-'."

#: 5e9f0e7060a74c49baa111ae1adbef82
msgid "对称化包含 SOC 的 Onsite 矩阵块 (尺寸为 2*nao_max)。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes onsite matrix blocks containing SOC (size 2*nao_max)."

#: 019b8b6b251b46f2bad002701fb154b1
msgid "对称化包含 SOC 的 Offsite 矩阵块 (尺寸为 2*nao_max)。"
msgstr "Symmetrizes offsite matrix blocks containing SOC (size 2*nao_max)."

#: 94c1719f3e504c868161ea82addcc2e0
msgid "计算能带结构（调试版本）。"
msgstr "Calculates the band structure (debug version)."

#: 2e0f2458dafa4e27b9663ebf9be8f9eb
msgid ""
"通过傅里叶变换将实空间的哈密顿量 H(R) 和重叠矩阵 S(R) 转换为 倒易空间的 H(k) 和 S(k)，然后求解广义本征值问题 `H(k)c"
" = ES(k)c` 来得到能带。"
msgstr ""
"Transforms the real-space Hamiltonian H(R) and overlap matrix S(R) to "
"reciprocal-space H(k) and S(k) via Fourier transform, then solves the "
"generalized eigenvalue problem `H(k)c = ES(k)c` to obtain the band structure."

#: 2a4c3ef4ab8c40968333707ec797d392
msgid "预测的 onsite 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Predicted onsite Hamiltonian."

#: 275074d3a583432b8df30f01839141fb
msgid "预测的 offsite 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Predicted offsite Hamiltonian."

#: 24e52698b513422e8222367d506a2865
msgid "预测的 onsite 重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Predicted onsite overlap matrix."

#: 882db1129aa943ab9e35649cbb3ad94d
msgid "预测的 offsite 重叠矩阵。"
msgstr "Predicted offsite overlap matrix."

#: b2ab37274e5348d28f27a1d152d4a70a
msgid "输入数据。"
msgstr "Input data."

#: 7fb5545511b744768c1cd39572b06961
msgid "是否返回倒易空间矩阵。"
msgstr "Whether to return reciprocal-space matrices."

#: 490ab682cbde4b6c889e126df40847ee
msgid "包含能带能量、波函数、带隙等信息的元组。"
msgstr "A tuple containing information such as band energy, wavefunctions, and band gap."

#: 93c032891c734bd5bdcd34beae8054dc
msgid "计算能带结构（非调试的正式版本）。"
msgstr "Calculates the band structure (official, non-debug version)."

#: 1603e571745743af9241b2bcd894bc20
msgid ""
"此函数通过给定的 onsite 和 offsite 矩阵块，为一批晶体构建 k 点依赖的哈密顿量 "
"和重叠矩阵，然后通过求解广义本征值问题来计算能带结构。 该过程与 `cal_band_energy_debug` "
"类似，但流程更精简，不涉及对预计算 `Son`, `Soff` 的依赖。"
msgstr ""
"This function constructs k-point dependent Hamiltonians and overlap matrices "
"for a batch of crystals from given onsite and offsite matrix blocks, then "
"calculates the band structure by solving the generalized eigenvalue problem. "
"The process is similar to `cal_band_energy_debug` but more streamlined, "
"without dependency on pre-calculated `Son` and `Soff`."

#: 2b8969951ecf49caaaaea6e2cae1a6c8 89ba92e346604e689822c651d2f888b8
msgid "当前实现主要针对 `openmx` 类型的哈密顿量。"
msgstr "The current implementation primarily targets `openmx`-type Hamiltonians."

#: 1f8b9c68e90844a1b80ffd1cf408c5a9
msgid "批处理中所有原子/轨道的 Onsite 矩阵块，形状通常为 `(N_nodes, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr "Onsite matrix blocks for all atoms/orbitals in the batch, typically with a shape of `(N_nodes, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: 90b5af11f3f242b0ac6b9ff00aa610a6
msgid "批处理中所有边的 Offsite 矩阵块，形状通常为 `(N_edges, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr "Offsite matrix blocks for all edges in the batch, typically with a shape of `(N_edges, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: d6750f3cc592438786664b6e0da00854
msgid "PyG 图数据对象，包含原子结构、k点等信息。"
msgstr "PyG graph data object, containing atomic structure, k-points, and other information."

#: e1ecba1820604776867e0a6d7ad91fbe
msgid "如果为 True，则额外返回倒易空间中的 哈密顿量 `HK`、重叠矩阵 `SK`、`SK`的导数`dSK` 和波函数。默认为 `False`。"
msgstr "If True, additionally returns the Hamiltonian `HK`, overlap matrix `SK`, derivative of `SK` `dSK`, and wavefunctions in reciprocal space. Defaults to `False`."

#: 28b368e701524b2ba9db649b316f67c4
msgid ""
"如果 `export_reciprocal_values` 为 `False`，返回 `(band_energy, wavefunction, "
"gap, H_sym)`。 如果 `export_reciprocal_values` 为 `True`，返回 `(band_energy, "
"wavefunction, HK, SK, dSK, gap)`。"
msgstr ""
"If `export_reciprocal_values` is `False`, returns `(band_energy, "
"wavefunction, gap, H_sym)`. If `export_reciprocal_values` is `True`, returns "
"`(band_energy, wavefunction, HK, SK, dSK, gap)`."

#: 9347d54c986640d5a04474776a19bf05
msgid "计算包含自旋轨道耦合（SOC）的能带结构。"
msgstr "Calculates the band structure including spin-orbit coupling (SOC)."

#: 099cb006ffd448b291a3fa9dd31acfb7
msgid ""
"此方法通过给定的 onsite 和 offsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部和虚部，构建一个 2x2 的块矩阵来表示完整的 SOC "
"哈密顿量。其中，对角线块是自旋守恒的部分， 非对角线块是自旋翻转的部分。然后通过求解该复厄米矩阵的本征值问题得到能带。"
msgstr ""
"This method constructs a 2x2 block matrix to represent the full SOC "
"Hamiltonian from the given real and imaginary parts of the onsite and "
"offsite SOC Hamiltonians. The diagonal blocks are the spin-conserving parts, "
"and the off-diagonal blocks are the spin-flipping parts. The band structure "
"is then obtained by solving the eigenvalue problem of this complex Hermitian "
"matrix."

#: 37188a043f014ca59ebdc0ee6b63c434
msgid "Onsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部。"
msgstr "Real part of the onsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 69cb08d8aab94f6bba771fa68d9e585a
msgid "Onsite SOC 哈密顿量的虚部。"
msgstr "Imaginary part of the onsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 3ee7b0d66a1a46e58c3fc2bd6e078378
msgid "Offsite SOC 哈密顿量的实部。"
msgstr "Real part of the offsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: a8d93e3847de422c96f232757e21543d
msgid "Offsite SOC 哈密顿量的虚部。"
msgstr "Imaginary part of the offsite SOC Hamiltonian."

#: bfb7a7d8b40d4564ac02fc549947f8bc
msgid "输入数据，包含原子结构、k点、重叠矩阵等信息。"
msgstr "Input data, containing atomic structure, k-points, overlap matrix, etc."

#: 9b01d30ab5b8431ea46c18171bbe38cc
msgid "返回一个包含能带能量 `band_energy` 和扁平化的波函数 `wavefunction` 的元组。"
msgstr "Returns a tuple containing the band energy `band_energy` and the flattened wavefunction `wavefunction`."

#: 140a09870bd446b29b5606c89a1efa45
msgid "根据每种原子的实际轨道数，对哈密顿量和重叠矩阵进行掩码操作。"
msgstr "Masks the Hamiltonian and overlap matrix according to the actual number of orbitals for each atom type."

#: 467995f723234e2a90bf1a7062bab74a
msgid "此函数确保只有在物理上存在的原子轨道之间的矩阵元才具有非零值， 而那些由于使用固定大小 `nao_max` 导致的填充项则被置零。"
msgstr "This function ensures that only matrix elements between physically existing atomic orbitals have non-zero values, while those padding entries resulting from the use of a fixed size `nao_max` are set to zero."

#: 4b5a19290f1a48ea97e382034e2157e4
msgid "Onsite 矩阵块 (哈密顿量或重叠矩阵)。"
msgstr "Onsite matrix blocks (Hamiltonian or overlap matrix)."

#: bcc958bb96ef4830973eea91866a0870
msgid "Offsite 矩阵块 (哈密顿量或重叠矩阵)。"
msgstr "Offsite matrix blocks (Hamiltonian or overlap matrix)."

#: a46b92bfe8234fde9af06e4e144f3ab9
msgid "输入数据，需要 `z` 和 `edge_index`。"
msgstr "Input data, requires `z` and `edge_index`."

#: 6994a9552f2548de908700d8098c41ad
msgid "返回一个元组，包含掩码后的 `(Hon, Hoff)`。"
msgstr "Returns a tuple containing the masked `(Hon, Hoff)`."

#: ec1b66ce0fe94c07a1c67743acdacd88
msgid "从自旋对角（实部）和自旋非对角（虚部）块构建复数 SOC 哈密顿量。"
msgstr "Constructs the complex SOC Hamiltonian from spin-diagonal (real part) and spin-off-diagonal (imaginary part) blocks."

#: 50ad861e92b84f8798f295c27728f469
msgid "SOC 哈密顿量的实部块。"
msgstr "Real part blocks of the SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 1967f12e42df49d09f5232c2f5bc7db9
msgid "SOC 哈密顿量的虚部块。"
msgstr "Imaginary part blocks of the SOC Hamiltonian."

#: 3047291dce354445a42eba69cb79f390
msgid "完整的复数 SOC 哈密顿量张量。"
msgstr "The complete complex SOC Hamiltonian tensor."

#: 72ab3ddb6edc40f3ad1c9db189ede7cc
msgid "通过 Clebsch-Gordan 分解，将矩阵块分解为球谐系数（等变特征）。"
msgstr "Decomposes matrix blocks into spherical harmonic coefficients (equivariant features) via Clebsch-Gordan decomposition."

#: e8c9e16045a744568a15973f2e0bc8d2
msgid ""
"这是 `matrix_merge` 的逆过程。它通过在轨道组内取平均值来近似地提取 具有特定角动量 `l` "
"的特征分量。这主要用于调试或分析目的，以检查 网络是否学习到了符合物理对称性的特征。"
msgstr ""
"This is the inverse process of `matrix_merge`. It approximately extracts "
"feature components with a specific angular momentum `l` by averaging within "
"orbital groups. This is mainly used for debugging or analysis purposes to "
"check if the network has learned features that conform to physical symmetries."

#: d2bf91796ecb4f3c9546a0707bf7eb83
msgid "形状为 `(N, nao_max, nao_max)` 的矩阵块。"
msgstr "Matrix blocks with a shape of `(N, nao_max, nao_max)`."

#: d4c44b7621d7447899df16cebf6970de
msgid "分解得到的球谐系数，形状被重新扁平化为 `(N, nao_max*nao_max)`。"
msgstr "The resulting spherical harmonic coefficients from decomposition, reshaped to `(N, nao_max*nao_max)`."

#: 3d8268c0432447e0a681e309b73fb6f1
msgid "将每个唯一的晶胞位移向量映射到其在唯一列表中的索引。"
msgstr "Maps each unique unit cell shift vector to its index in the unique list."

#: 1ecce34736464ae78188c02e6a0e88a3
msgid "唯一晶胞位移向量的列表。"
msgstr "A list of unique unit cell shift vectors."

#: 97a00b060c494556b60f20cf349d6e9a
msgid "一个字典，键是晶胞位移元组，值是其索引。"
msgstr "A dictionary where keys are unit cell shift tuples and values are their indices."

#: facc4c06f2ab43ef904119a1bd5d90bc
msgid "从边的晶胞位移中找到唯一的位移向量，并为每条边提供其对应的唯一位移索引。"
msgstr "Finds unique shift vectors from the edge cell shifts and provides each edge with its corresponding unique shift index."

#: 0b76d67fc9264e7da32cd6d30a006859 2d33cb3525c642729f02941714c20117
#: 8effd0ee61764fdf9b8c130ea0e8e686 e37ea6e8703249ca882011f84ba21767
msgid "PyG 图数据对象。"
msgstr "PyG graph data object."

#: 069cae765da7445a9d28a0aea8dd938b
msgid "返回 `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, cell_index_map)`。"
msgstr "Returns `(unique_cell_shift, cell_shift_indices, cell_index_map)`."

#: 64db2a4abc024bb59440a287423e65eb
msgid "为掩码计算创建并返回基组定义张量。"
msgstr "Creates and returns the basis set definition tensor for mask calculation."

#: 9241b659d75e4dc09ff6a70d7ac17b87
msgid "原子序数张量。"
msgstr "Atomic number tensor."

#: cd204c5da995400e95219efece0bd320
msgid ""
"一个 `(99, nao_max)` 的张量，其中 `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`               表示原子"
" `z` 包含轨道 `i`。"
msgstr ""
"A `(99, nao_max)` tensor where `basis_definition[z, i] = 1` indicates that "
"atom `z` includes orbital `i`."

#: 1d1a7be63073479291ad48d192b08245
msgid "一个 `(99, nao_max)` 的张量，其中 `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`"
msgstr "A `(99, nao_max)` tensor where `basis_definition[z, i] = 1`"

#: 8c0dd57ca4bc471ba4f7fac251323dad
msgid "表示原子 `z` 包含轨道 `i`。"
msgstr "indicates that atom `z` includes orbital `i`."

#: 7192f8a5fa8543e89a69283dc23fc661
msgid "构建掩码张量并返回拼接后的掩码张量。"
msgstr "Builds the mask tensor and returns the concatenated mask tensor."

#: bd7afa7d02bc4064859e9f0c12cc3e2e
msgid "拼接后的 on-site 和 off-site 掩码。"
msgstr "The concatenated on-site and off-site masks."

#: 07666dca66f446838c68bcf0e3f71fe3
msgid "为共线自旋情况构建掩码张量。"
msgstr "Builds the mask tensor for the collinear spin case."

#: d4ebf2cdf9434b74850e21c459b1ab80
msgid "适用于共线自旋计算的拼接掩码。"
msgstr "The concatenated mask suitable for collinear spin calculations."

#: d9d7d6f0df194d4fad4f4ba87340a544
msgid "为包含自旋轨道耦合的情况构建掩码张量。"
msgstr "Builds the mask tensor for the case including spin-orbit coupling."

#: d9e1fe4a3e954b6b8148308265cb0cf9
msgid "返回一个元组 `(mask_real_imag, mask_all)`，        分别对应 SOC 哈密顿量的实部/虚部掩码和总掩码。"
msgstr "Returns a tuple `(mask_real_imag, mask_all)`, corresponding to the real/imaginary part mask and the total mask of the SOC Hamiltonian, respectively."

#: b1bcb7faebcb41148b9f862a727363b6
msgid "返回一个元组 `(mask_real_imag, mask_all)`，"
msgstr "Returns a tuple `(mask_real_imag, mask_all)`,"

#: b7c6246f02cc44d5a68bd95f2a318fc3
msgid "分别对应 SOC 哈密顿量的实部/虚部掩码和总掩码。"
msgstr "corresponding to the real/imaginary part mask and the total mask of the SOC Hamiltonian, respectively."

#: b46cf0b59404423bbdb319ae72d324ec
msgid "模型的核心前向传播逻辑。"
msgstr "The core forward propagation logic of the model."

#: 36afc5a3a2b24c808a0fdc75dd24affa
msgid ""
"该方法根据 `__init__` 中设置的各种开关（如 `soc_switch`, `spin_constrained` 等）， "
"执行不同的计算路径来构建哈密顿量和重叠矩阵，并最终计算能带结构等物理属性。"
msgstr ""
"This method executes different computational paths to construct the "
"Hamiltonian and overlap matrix based on various switches set in `__init__` "
"(e.g., `soc_switch`, `spin_constrained`), and ultimately calculates physical "
"properties like the band structure."

#: 15b1dfbccd834a8f84e537fbe109e780
msgid "PyG 图数据对象，可能包含预计算的矩阵。"
msgstr "PyG graph data object, which may contain pre-calculated matrices."

#: c10809308da944f8a28ac6e9cd8a1e5b
msgid "来自 GNN 表示层的节点和边等变特征字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary of equivariant node and edge features from the GNN representation layer."

#: addc246100244287a409666c4be508b5
msgid ""
"一个包含计算结果的字典，可能包括 'hamiltonian', 'overlap',       'band_energy', "
"'wavefunction' 等键。"
msgstr ""
"A dictionary containing the calculation results, which may include keys such "
"as 'hamiltonian', 'overlap', 'band_energy', 'wavefunction'."

#: b286aa9211f142f7bb2457f76e10e953
msgid "一个包含计算结果的字典，可能包括 'hamiltonian', 'overlap',"
msgstr "A dictionary containing the calculation results, which may include 'hamiltonian', 'overlap',"

#: 9715ce0a662745a0aeac64071b2d166a
msgid "'band_energy', 'wavefunction' 等键。"
msgstr "'band_energy', 'wavefunction', and other keys."